{"symbol":"VIL.PA","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:19:44Z","info":{"address1":"9 place Vendôme","city":"Paris","zip":"75001","country":"France","phone":"33 1 56 43 70 20","fax":"33 1 56 43 70 98","website":"https://www.viel.com","industry":"Capital Markets","industryKey":"capital-markets","industryDisp":"Capital Markets","sector":"Financial Services","sectorKey":"financial-services","sectorDisp":"Financial Services","longBusinessSummary":"VIEL & Cie, société anonyme, an investment company, provides interdealer broking, online trading, and private banking services in France, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Americas, and the Asia-Pacific region. It operates through Professional Intermediation, Online stock exchange, Private Banking, and Real Estate and Other Activities segments. The company offers intermediation services in a range of financial products, including money markets, bond markets, interest rates, foreign exchange and credit derivatives, equities and equity derivatives, interest rate and index futures; and non-financial products, such as energy, environment, and precious metals. It also provides online trading services covering a range of products comprising French and foreign stocks, mutual funds, ETFs, derivatives, trackers, warrants, certificates, turbos, life insurance, and savings products, as well as white-label back-office solutions and order execution services for financial institutions. In addition, the company offers private banking services for direct clients; wealth management advisors; securities custodian; and retail banking services for individuals and professionals, as well as engages in real estate activities. It serves financial institutions and other professional traders in the capital markets; and individual investors. VIEL & Cie, société anonyme was incorporated in 1962 and is based in Paris, France. VIEL & Cie, société anonyme operates as a subsidiary of VIEL et Compagnie Finance SE.","fullTimeEmployees":2600,"companyOffi